[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一行人决定前往<br>最有可能找到证据的尸体目击现场。|#0101Adv26_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的步伐十分沉重。<br>或许是因为，她非常不愿意直视诺亚的尸体。|#0101Adv26_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:而此时，雪莉的步伐则是一蹦一跳的。|#0101Adv26_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我说你，是不是太过神经大条了？<br>真亏你走路还能一蹦一跳的。|#0101Adv26_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，我可是很会察言观色的哦？<br>在学校里我知道大家都会避开我，所以我也会主动拉开距离哦。|#0101Adv26_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你这是明显被人孤立了欸？|#0101Adv26_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:没这回事啦！<br>大家都很亲切地喊我【小仙子】呢！|#0101Adv26_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那绝对不是什么正面称呼啦。|#0101Adv26_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽然才刚有人过世……<br>　不过汉娜能稍微恢复精神，真是太好了）|#0101Adv26_Ema001|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看到她们两个在拌嘴的样子，艾玛感到有些暖心。|#0101Adv26_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:说起来，昨天晚上<br>我们在诺亚房间附近看到亚里沙了。|#0101Adv26_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听艾玛不经意地说到，<br>雪莉非常感兴趣地插进了话题。|#0101Adv26_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙和我是同一间房的。我们的房间是最外面的那间，<br>她走到里面是不是有别的事呢？|#0101Adv26_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:我是感觉她看起来有点慌张……|#0101Adv26_Hanna004| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，我也是。感觉她有点奇怪。|#0101Adv26_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:真令人在意耶～！<br>看来很有必要找亚里沙问话了。|#0101Adv26_Sherry004| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（难道是亚里沙把诺亚给……？）|#0101Adv26_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛马上否定了这个念头。|#0101Adv26_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（单方面断定并不好。<br>　还是尽量先调查吧）|#0101Adv26_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:在聊着天的时候，<br>艾玛一行人不知不觉走到了诺亚的牢房前。|#0101Adv26_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（诺亚……）|#0101Adv26_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了调查，必须认真仔细去观察。<br>艾玛忍住泪水，开始观察诺亚的牢房内部。|#0101Adv26_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [still illust 27]
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:270_2

[PrintTextModified Text:冰凉的，再也不会动的诺亚的遗体，<br>正躺在房内的正中间。|#0101Adv26_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:2_1

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:唔，没法进去里面太难办了……<br>总之，先拍下现场的照片吧。|#0101Adv26_Sherry005| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉取出手机，<br>开始拍摄房内的情况。|#0101Adv26_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; [sfx 28：写真撮影音]
; ========================================

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_28 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:亏你能想得到<br>把这么残忍的景象拍下来……|#0101Adv26_Hanna005| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:因为这是搜查的基础！|#0101Adv26_Sherry006| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉神气地说道。然后她好像想到了什么似的，<br>举起了食指说。|#0101Adv26_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:说来，我们在聊天APP上<br>还没有添加好友耶。|#0101Adv26_Sherry007| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在APP上添加了好友后，<br>不仅可以传文字信息，还可以通话，<br>也可以传图片哦。|#0101Adv26_Sherry008| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸，这样啊……！|#0101Adv26_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:和我们平常用的聊天工具基本一样呢。<br>那……|#0101Adv26_Hanna006| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:雪莉和汉娜熟练地将对方添加为好友后，<br>转过头面向艾玛。|#0101Adv26_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Flushed1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊、呃、那个……|#0101Adv26_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（怎么办，我不知道怎么弄……<br>　我用我原来的手机都<br>　从没添加过好友……！）|#0101Adv26_Ema009|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛不知所措，直冒冷汗。<br>好在有雪莉和汉娜教她，<br>艾玛总算成功添加了好友。|#0101Adv26_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Flushed1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:这下子，我和艾玛，还有汉娜<br>就可以随时联络了！|#0101Adv26_Sherry009| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯。之后也得跟梅露露加一下好友。|#0101Adv26_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

