[PrintTextModified Text:这张水果的照片是……？|#0101Adv26_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，这个是我昨天拍的！<br>总感觉应该纪念一下！|#0101Adv26_Sherry010| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是要纪念什么东西啊……|#0101Adv26_Hanna007| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:270_2

[PrintTextModified Text:讲完了图片的话题，<br>三人继续观察现实里的尸体目击现场。|#0101Adv26_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:地板是一片纯白色，<br>这是用诺亚用喷漆弄的，对吧。|#0101Adv26_Sherry011| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，诺亚说她要重新画其他东西。<br>所以我猜，她才会把地板先弄成白色的。|#0101Adv26_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:以防万一，艾玛把手伸进了铁栅栏内，<br>在摸得到的范围内触碰了一下白色的颜料。|#0101Adv26_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（颜料已经干了。<br>　我就说肯定是诺亚昨晚涂的）|#0101Adv26_Ema013|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:既然如此，如果有足迹的话就会相当明显呢。<br>但诺亚身边都没看到足迹。|#0101Adv26_Sherry012| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那么，不飞在半空中接近诺亚，<br>就没法把她杀死耶！|#0101Adv26_Sherry013| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0101Adv26_Hanna008| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然可以透过铁栅栏看到内部，<br>但是它的缝隙并不宽，最多只能让手伸进去。|#0101Adv26_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而诺亚的遗体在室内的中间位置。<br>不靠近她本人应该没法杀死她。|#0101Adv26_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不、不过呢，应该有办法在外面就能杀人。<br>啊，你们看！|#0101Adv26_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyCamera Offset:-6,3 Zoom:0.5 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛指着的，<br>是掉落在诺亚遗体附近的一根短箭。|#0101Adv26_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这不是弩枪的箭吗！？|#0101Adv26_Sherry014| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

