[PrintTextModified Text:诺亚是被弩枪刺中胸口死掉的……？|#0101Adv26_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能性相当高！<br>而且，也可以证明在房外也能作案。|#0101Adv26_Sherry015| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

