[PrintTextModified Text:真亏你们能一直死盯着现场看……<br>反正我感觉很不舒服……|#0101Adv26_Hanna009| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（那其实，我现在也非常非常地不舒服……）|#0101Adv26_Ema020| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛忍住没让某物冲出喉咙，<br>然后摇了摇头。这时她的表情瞬间变得僵硬起来。|#0101Adv26_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:没有血液的味道。不对，是因为喷漆的刺鼻气味<br>挡住了血腥味……|#0101Adv26_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
@Wait WaitMode:0.6

[PrintTextModified Text:因为诺亚生前不断地<br>在狭小的牢房里喷洒着颜料喷漆。|#0101Adv26_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即便现在她已过世，房内也仍然充满了喷漆的刺激气味。|#0101Adv26_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛将手机对准掉落在诺亚身旁的<br>喷漆罐，放大焦距后拍下照片。|#0101Adv26_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

